cmd.whereami=Show position, dimension, biome and chunk.
cmd.compass=Point towards your spawn point.
cmd.distance=Distance and direction to a coordinate.
cmd.look=Describe what is in front of you.
cmd.playtime=Show ticks, play time and day.
cmd.date=Show the date and season.
cmd.moon=Show the moon phase.
cmd.sun=Show sunrise, sunset and daylight.
cmd.forecast=Show the current weather and its details.
cmd.weathers=List all weather types.
cmd.light=Show daylight and your light radius.
cmd.climate=Show the climate of a column.
cmd.height=Show the surface height of a column.
cmd.depth=Show how deep below the surface you are.
cmd.biomeat=Show the biome at a coordinate.
cmd.blockat=Show the block at a coordinate.
cmd.survey=Survey the terrain around you.
cmd.map=Draw a biome map around you.
cmd.count=Count a block type around you.
cmd.orescan=Count the ores around you.
cmd.ores=List ore types and their heights.
cmd.highest=Show the highest block above you.
cmd.biomeinfo=Show the definition of a biome.
cmd.loottables=List all loot tables.
cmd.lootinfo=Show the contents of a loot table.
cmd.effectlist=List all status effect types.
cmd.usedin=List the recipes that use an item.
cmd.itemsearch=Search items by id or name.
cmd.blocksearch=Search blocks by id or name.
cmd.nearest=Find the nearest creature (of a type).
cmd.hostiles=List hostile creatures nearby.
cmd.lootof=Show what a creature drops.
cmd.cargo=List the cargo of your ship.
cmd.portals=Find portals nearby.
cmd.mine=Attack or mine in front of you (like F).
cmd.place=Place the selected item (like R).
cmd.use=Use the selected item (like U).
cmd.interact=Interact with what is in front of you (like E).
cmd.drop=Drop one or all of the selected item.
cmd.face=Turn to a direction.
cmd.step=Take one step in a direction.
cmd.unstuck=Move up out of solid blocks.
cmd.eat=Eat the most nourishing food you carry.
cmd.treat=Use a medicine against an active illness or injury.
cmd.equipbest=Wear the best armour you carry.
cmd.sort=Sort your inventory.
cmd.stack=Merge partial stacks.
cmd.swap=Swap two inventory slots.
cmd.deposit=Put items into the chest in front of you.
cmd.withdraw=Take items from the chest in front of you.
cmd.loadcargo=Put items into your ship's hold.
cmd.unload=Take items out of your ship's hold.
cmd.chestinfo=List the chest in front of you.
cmd.emptychest=Empty the chest in front of you.
cmd.repairall=Fully repair all tools and armour.
cmd.maxskills=Set every skill to a level.
cmd.resetskills=Reset every skill to 0.
cmd.stop=Stop your ship.
cmd.turn=Turn your ship to a direction.
cmd.ai=Freeze or unfreeze creature AI.
cmd.killhostile=Remove all hostile creatures.
cmd.mobcap=Show the creature count and limit.
cmd.lightning=Strike lightning.
cmd.dawn=Set the time to 06:00.
cmd.noon=Set the time to 12:00.
cmd.dusk=Set the time to 19:00.
cmd.midnight=Set the time to 00:00.
cmd.storm=Start a storm.
cmd.calm=Clear the weather.
cmd.fluidinfo=Show the fluid level in front of you.
cmd.sponge=Remove fluids around you.
cmd.constellations=List the constellations of this world.
cmd.deathpoint=Show where you died last.
cmd.waypoint=Add, remove or list waypoints.
cmd.navigate=Direction and distance to a waypoint.
cmd.gowaypoint=Teleport to a waypoint.
cmd.sky=Open the sky view.
cmd.openinv=Open the inventory.
cmd.opencraft=Open crafting.
cmd.openstats=Open the character sheet.
cmd.panel=Choose the status panel page.
cmd.log=Show recent messages.
cmd.say=Write a note into the message log.
cmd.history=Show the command history.
cmd.aliases=List command aliases.
cmd.keys=List the key bindings.
cmd.topics=List all help topics.
cmd.helpsearch=Search the help.
cmd.hint=Give a tip for the current situation.
cmd.tick=Show the simulation tick.
cmd.audio=Show the audio back end.
cmd.sounds=List sound effects.
cmd.playsound=Play a sound effect.
cmd.sound=Turn sound on or off.
cmd.license=Show the license.
cmd.creator=Show the creator.
cmd.colors=Show the 16 colours.
cmd.glyphs=Show the CP437 glyph table.

